---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Board & Leadership" description="Meet Phillip Wade Gale, founder and planned President & Executive Director of GEAR Moto Foundation, and learn about its developing board and team.">
  <section class="lead-hero">
    <div class="wrap lead-hero-layout">
      <div>
        <span class="lead-eyebrow">The People Behind the Mission</span>
        <h1>BOARD &amp;<br/><span>LEADERSHIP.</span></h1>
        <p>Rider-built leadership. Responsible governance. A stronger community for every kind of rider.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lead-hero-aside" aria-label="GEAR mission pillars">
        <span>ALL BIKES.</span><span>ALL RIDERS.</span>
        <div class="lead-hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <small>GEAR · EDUCATION · ASSISTANCE · RECOVERY</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lead-section" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="lead-intro"><span class="lead-eyebrow">Founding Leadership</span><p>Building a foundation with a clear mission and the professional experience to help bring it to life.</p></div>
      <div class="lead-profile">
        <figure class="lead-photo lead-photo-ready">
          <img src="/images/gear-wade-founder-cropped.avif" alt="Phillip Wade Gale in motorcycle riding gear beside his red Ducati Monster" width="240" height="300" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"/>
          <figcaption>Phillip “Wade” Gale · Founder</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="lead-copy">
          <span class="lead-eyebrow">Founder &amp; Executive Leadership</span>
          <h2 id="founder-title">PHILLIP <span>“WADE”</span> GALE</h2>
          <p class="lead-role">Founder, President &amp; Executive Director</p>
          <p>Wade brings experience across event and exhibit production, marketing, public relations, business development and community engagement. His professional work has included leading teams, producing complex events, developing partnerships and connecting people around a shared purpose.</p>
          <p>A rider since his teens, Wade's experience spans off-road motorcycles and street bikes. Today he rides a Ducati Monster, and his <em>Ducati Afterdark</em> project reflects his enthusiasm for motorcycle culture, responsible riding and the connections forged within the riding community.</p>
          <p>He founded GEAR Moto Foundation around a practical belief: riders deserve better access to protective gear, education, helpful resources and a path toward recovery after a serious crash. His vision is simple: <strong>all bikes, all riders, and a community that shows up for one another.</strong></p>
          <div class="lead-values" aria-label="Leadership priorities">
            <span>Safer Riders</span><span>Stronger Community</span><span>Partnerships</span><span>Lasting Impact</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lead-socials">
            <h3>Connect with Wade</h3>
            <div class="lead-social-links">
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ducati.afterdark/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram Ducati Afterdark, opens in a new tab"><span>Instagram · Riding</span><strong>@ducati.afterdark <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong></a>
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/wadegaleart/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram Wade Gale Art, opens in a new tab"><span>Instagram · Art</span><strong>@wadegaleart <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong></a>
              <a href="https://www.wadegale.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Wade Gale professional portfolio, opens in a new tab"><span>Professional Portfolio</span><strong>WadeGale.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lead-status"><strong>Leadership &amp; governance status:</strong> Wade is the founder and designated executive leader during development. Formal corporate offices, board appointments and governance authority remain subject to formation, adoption of governing documents and applicable approvals. <a href="/governance/">Read our governance status ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lead-future" aria-labelledby="board-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="lead-eyebrow">Building the Team</span>
      <h2>STRONGER TOGETHER.</h2>
      <div class="lead-future-grid">
        <article class="lead-future-card">
          <span class="lead-card-index">01 / BOARD OF DIRECTORS</span>
          <h3 id="board-heading">Independent Board</h3>
          <p>GEAR is developing a working, independent board to help oversee the mission, finances, policies and long-term sustainability. Additional director profiles will appear here after appointments are confirmed.</p>
          <a href="/governance/">How GEAR intends to be governed ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="lead-future-card">
          <span class="lead-card-index">02 / TEAM &amp; VOLUNTEERS</span>
          <h3>Team &amp; Community</h3>
          <p>As the organization grows, this space will introduce the people helping with rider outreach, events, partnerships, education and future programs. We are currently welcoming volunteer interest.</p>
          <a href="/volunteer/">Explore volunteer opportunities ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lead-closing">
    <div class="wrap lead-closing-inner">
      <div><span class="lead-eyebrow">Riders Helping Riders</span><h2>HELP BUILD WHAT<br/>COMES NEXT.</h2><p>GEAR is in development. Connect with us about board expertise, community partnerships or volunteering.</p></div>
      <div class="lead-closing-links"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation ↗</a><a class="btn lead-outline" href="/volunteer/">Get Involved ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
.lead-hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 84% 23%,#333c45 0%,transparent 38%),linear-gradient(123deg,#0b1015 0%,#19232c 70%,#10171e);color:white;border-bottom:6px solid #d71920;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.lead-hero:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.12;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent 0,transparent 62px,#fff 63px,transparent 64px)}
.lead-hero-layout{position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:340px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding-top:65px;padding-bottom:70px}
.lead-eyebrow{display:block;color:#b6131d;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}
.lead-hero .lead-eyebrow,.lead-closing .lead-eyebrow{color:#ff858d}
.lead-hero h1{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(65px,9vw,130px);line-height:.87;margin:18px 0 26px}
.lead-hero h1 span{color:#ff4851}
.lead-hero p{font-size:17px;max-width:590px;color:#e2e6eb;line-height:1.75}
.lead-hero-aside{flex-shrink:0;width:210px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:5px;font:700 21px/1.2 'Barlow Condensed',Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em}
.lead-hero-rule{width:46px;height:4px;background:#f13c46;margin:18px 0 6px}
.lead-hero-aside small{font:700 10px/1.7 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#cbd4dc;letter-spacing:.08em}
.lead-section{background:#fff;padding:clamp(55px,7vw,95px) 0 70px}
.lead-intro{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;margin-bottom:28px}
.lead-intro p{max-width:460px;font-size:14px;color:#616b75;margin:0}
.lead-profile{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(270px,.72fr) minmax(0,1.28fr);gap:clamp(30px,5vw,75px);align-items:start}
.lead-photo{aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;min-height:360px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:28px;overflow:hidden;border:2px dashed #9ba5ad;background:linear-gradient(155deg,#e5e9ec 0%,#f5f6f7 55%,#dfe5e9 100%);border-radius:5px}
.lead-photo:before,.lead-photo:after{content:'';position:absolute;height:210px;width:210px;border:1px solid #cbd2d7;transform:rotate(45deg);pointer-events:none}
.lead-photo:before{left:-160px;top:-130px}.lead-photo:after{right:-120px;bottom:-130px}
.lead-photo-mark{position:relative;width:110px;height:122px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:start;opacity:.55}
.lead-photo-head{position:absolute;width:49px;height:49px;top:4px;background:#778692;border-radius:50%}
.lead-photo-shoulders{position:absolute;bottom:7px;width:105px;height:60px;background:#778692;border-radius:55px 55px 7px 7px}
.lead-photo-label{text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.lead-photo-label span{font-size:11px;color:#656f78;letter-spacing:.24em;font-weight:800}
.lead-photo-label strong{font:800 30px/1 'Barlow Condensed',Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#111820}
.lead-copy h2{font-size:clamp(46px,5vw,73px);line-height:.95;margin:15px 0 10px;letter-spacing:.005em}
.lead-copy h2 span{color:#d71920}
.lead-role{font:800 clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px)/1.1 'Barlow Condensed',Impact,sans-serif;color:#c71924;margin:0 0 25px!important}
.lead-copy p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 18px}
.lead-values{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:25px 0 33px}
.lead-values span{background:#f2f4f5;color:#313a43;border-left:3px solid #d71920;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.035em}
.lead-socials{border-top:1px solid #dde2e6;padding-top:24px}
.lead-socials h3{font-size:29px;margin:0 0 14px}
.lead-social-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.lead-social-links a{border:1px solid #dbe1e5;border-bottom:3px solid #d71920;padding:13px 12px;color:#111820;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-width:0}
.lead-social-links a:hover{background:#f4f5f6;color:#a80f15}
.lead-social-links a span{font-size:10px;color:#68727d;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
.lead-social-links a strong{font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.lead-social-links a strong span{font-size:14px;color:#d71920}
.lead-status{margin-top:32px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#46525d;padding:17px 21px;background:#f4f5f6;border-left:4px solid #d71920}
.lead-status a{font-weight:800}
.lead-future{background:#eef1f3;padding:clamp(58px,6vw,90px) 0}
.lead-future h2{font-size:clamp(46px,5vw,75px);margin:10px 0 26px}
.lead-future-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}
.lead-future-card{padding:clamp(25px,3vw,42px);background:#fff;border-top:5px solid #d71920}
.lead-card-index{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#b4161e}
.lead-future-card h3{margin:19px 0;font-size:39px}
.lead-future-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;max-width:480px}
.lead-future-card a{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}
.lead-closing{background:#111820;padding:70px 0;color:#fff}
.lead-closing-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px}
.lead-closing h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,70px);margin:14px 0}
.lead-closing p{max-width:540px;color:#d4dce1}
.lead-closing-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.lead-outline{border-color:#b6c0c9;background:transparent;color:white}
@media(max-width:1020px){.lead-social-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:760px){.lead-hero-layout{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:0}.lead-hero-aside{width:auto;font-size:17px}.lead-intro{display:block}.lead-intro p{margin-top:10px}.lead-profile{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lead-photo{max-width:470px;min-height:340px}.lead-social-links{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.lead-future-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lead-closing-inner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
@media(max-width:460px){.lead-social-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lead-hero h1{font-size:59px}.lead-photo{min-height:300px}}
.lead-photo-ready{margin:0;display:block;min-height:0;border:0;position:relative;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;background:#111820}
.lead-photo-ready:before,.lead-photo-ready:after{content:none}
.lead-photo-ready img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}
.lead-photo-ready figcaption{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:30px 15px 13px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(11,17,24,.82));font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.03em}
</style>